# Logs
# ====================
logs/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

# ====================
# Temporary Files
# ====================
*.tmp
*.temp
.cache/
**/*.bak
**/*.backup
**/*.old
**/~*

# ====================
